  "versionMetadata": {
    "name": "Version 2afdfded",
    "description": "Approve now accepts optional positioning_output/icp_output patches in the request body and jsonb-merges them into the stored foundation before flipping status to approved, so review-screen edits (pillars, triggers, statement, persona) actually reach Stage 2 instead of being silently discarded. Backward compatible: omitting these fields merges {} (no-op)."
